name math
using resource asm
*FILETYPE compound

general set variable e to 2.718281828459045
general set variable inf to inf
general set variable nan to nan
general set variable pi to 3.141592653589793
general set variable tau to 6.283185307179586
general set variable zero to 0

designate e as type float
designate pi as type float
designate tau as type float
designate inf as type float


general set variable _T to TypeVar(_T)
general set variable _T_co to TypeVar(_T_co)